# ── 语言统计：HTML 稿不算进项目语言 ──
# 避免 GitHub 把含大量 HTML 的文档稿误判成 HTML 项目。
*.html    linguist-vendored

# ── 行尾符统一：避免 Windows / macOS 双端 diff 噪音 ──
* text=auto
*.ts    text eol=lf
*.tsx   text eol=lf
*.js    text eol=lf
*.mjs   text eol=lf
*.css   text eol=lf
*.json  text eol=lf
*.md    text eol=lf
*.yml   text eol=lf
*.yaml  text eol=lf

# ── 二进制：不做文本转换 ──
*.png   binary
*.jpg   binary
*.jpeg  binary
*.webp  binary
*.ico   binary
*.icns  binary
*.onnx  binary
*.exe   binary
*.dmg   binary
*.zip   binary
